flowchart LR
    Student[Student] --> Browser[Next.js Web Application]

    subgraph Frontend[Frontend]
        Browser --> ChatUI[Chat Workspace]
        Browser --> PlannerUI[Study Planner]
        Browser --> SourcesUI[Documents and Sources]
        Browser --> Identity[Stable Anonymous User ID]
    end

    ChatUI -->|POST /api/chat| API
    PlannerUI -->|GET POST PATCH /api/plans| API
    SourcesUI -->|GET POST /api/documents| API
    Identity -->|X-User-ID| API

    subgraph Backend[FastAPI Backend]
        API[FastAPI Routes and Pydantic Validation]
        API --> Conversations[Conversation Service]
        API --> Graph[LangGraph Assistant Workflow]
        API --> PlanAPI[Plan Service]
        API --> Ingestion[Document Ingestion]

        subgraph Orchestration[Bounded LangGraph Orchestration]
            Graph --> Analyze[Analyze Query]
            Analyze --> Rewrite[Rewrite Follow-up Query]
            Analyze --> Multi[Decompose Multi-step Request]
            Analyze --> PlanFlow[Create or Modify Plan]
            Analyze --> ToolFlow[Select Registered Tool]

            Rewrite --> Retrieve[Retrieve Evidence]
            Multi --> Retrieve
            Retrieve --> Evidence{Evidence Sufficient?}
            Evidence -->|Yes| Generate[Generate Grounded Answer]
            Evidence -->|No| Unknown[Return No-evidence Response]
            Generate --> Citations[Validate Citations]
            Citations --> Review[Review Response]
            Unknown --> Review
            PlanFlow --> Review
            ToolFlow --> Review
            Review --> Finalize[Finalize Structured Response]
        end

        Ingestion --> Extract[PDF or TXT Extraction]
        Extract --> Clean[Clean and Chunk]
        Clean --> Embed[FastEmbed BGE Embeddings]
        Embed --> VectorStore[(pgvector Document Chunks)]

        Retrieve --> QueryEmbed[Query Embedding]
        QueryEmbed --> VectorStore
        VectorStore --> Retrieve

        Generate --> LLM[Ollama gemma4:e2b]
        PlanFlow --> Planner[Deterministic Planner and Validator]
        ToolFlow --> Calculator[Safe AST Calculator]
        ToolFlow --> Calendar[Persistent Calendar Provider]

        Conversations --> Database[(PostgreSQL)]
        PlanAPI --> Planner
        Planner --> Database
        Calendar --> Database
        Ingestion --> Database
    end

    LLM --> OllamaBridge[Host Ollama Bridge]
    Finalize --> API
    API --> Browser
